WEBVTT

NOTE Plania · English

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.615
This is Plania. It does not replace your
management system: it connects to the one you

2
00:00:07.615 --> 00:00:13.000
already run and tells you what to do
with that data on Monday morning.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.263
The dashboard opens with what matters:
how much you sold, at what margin,

4
00:00:19.263 --> 00:00:24.000
how much capital is tied up and
how much revenue is at risk.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.795
Here are today's decisions: what
to discount and by how much,

6
00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:37.000
never below cost plus eight percent. What
to restock, and which prices leak margin.

7
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.940
And if you would rather ask, just ask.

8
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:47.004
The copilot answers by computing
on your data, not on generalities.

9
00:00:47.004 --> 00:00:54.879
We ask which items to discount this week and
it replies with the exact tied-up capital,

10
00:00:54.879 --> 00:01:01.125
the products that stopped moving and
the suggested discount for each.

11
00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:05.651
Below sits the table it used,
so you can check it.

12
00:01:05.651 --> 00:01:09.000
And it exports to PDF, Word or Excel.

13
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:17.000
Delivery routes build themselves,
vehicle by vehicle, minimising kilometres.

14
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.241
You connect your database in minutes.

15
00:01:20.241 --> 00:01:25.500
Seven days with everything unlocked,
no card required. Go to plania.uy.
